{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49437","headline":"浣溪沙 二 · 薛昭藴","name":"浣溪沙 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钿匣菱花锦带垂，静临兰槛卸头时，约鬟低珥算归期。\n花茂草青湘渚阔，梦余空有漏依依，二年终日损芳菲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛昭藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}